@sheet Raw [csv]
region,sales
North,200
South,180
East,240

@sheet Targets [json]
[
  { "region": "North", "target": 150 },
  { "region": "South", "target": 170 },
  { "region": "East", "target": 180 }
]

@sheet Summary
@header | Metric | Value |
| Sales | =SUM(Raw!sales) |
| Target | =SUM(Targets!target) |
| Gap | =B2-B3 |

@sheet Board
@header | Metric | Value |
| Gap copy | =Summary!B4 |
| Sales copy | =Summary!B2 |
